<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shelter (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864857545"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:56.274"><div begin="00:19.782" end="03:56.274"><p begin="00:19.782" end="00:23.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:19.782" end="00:20.069">I</span> <span begin="00:20.069" end="00:20.394">could</span> <span begin="00:20.394" end="00:20.677">ne</span><span begin="00:20.677" end="00:20.983">ver</span> <span begin="00:20.983" end="00:21.297">find</span> <span begin="00:21.297" end="00:21.568">the</span> <span begin="00:21.568" end="00:22.037">right</span> <span begin="00:22.037" end="00:22.465">way</span> <span begin="00:22.465" end="00:22.747">to</span> <span begin="00:22.747" end="00:23.242">tell</span> <span begin="00:23.242" end="00:23.617">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我找不到合理的方法告诉你</span></p><p begin="00:24.545" end="00:26.932" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:24.545" end="00:24.861">Have</span> <span begin="00:24.861" end="00:25.072">you</span> <span begin="00:25.072" end="00:25.375">no</span><span begin="00:25.375" end="00:25.659">ticed</span> <span begin="00:25.659" end="00:25.932">I've</span> <span begin="00:25.932" end="00:26.242">been</span> <span begin="00:26.242" end="00:26.932">gone?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否察觉 我的身影已经遥远</span></p><p begin="00:29.377" end="00:33.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:29.377" end="00:29.554">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:29.554" end="00:29.810">I</span> <span begin="00:29.810" end="00:30.277">left</span> <span begin="00:30.277" end="00:30.547">be</span><span begin="00:30.547" end="00:30.872">hind</span> <span begin="00:30.872" end="00:31.220">the</span> <span begin="00:31.220" end="00:31.679">home</span> <span begin="00:31.679" end="00:32.052">that</span> <span begin="00:32.052" end="00:32.360">you</span> <span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.823">made</span> <span begin="00:32.823" end="00:33.550">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我已渐行渐远 你所构建的港湾</span></p><p begin="00:34.036" end="00:36.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:34.036" end="00:34.188">But</span> <span begin="00:34.188" end="00:34.345">I</span> <span begin="00:34.345" end="00:34.629">will</span> <span begin="00:34.629" end="00:35.103">car</span><span begin="00:35.103" end="00:35.257">ry</span> <span begin="00:35.257" end="00:35.636">it</span> <span begin="00:35.636" end="00:35.838">a</span><span begin="00:35.838" end="00:36.481">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我仍会将它怀揣心中</span></p><p begin="00:38.988" end="00:43.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:38.988" end="00:39.121">When</span> <span begin="00:39.121" end="00:39.432">I'm</span> <span begin="00:39.432" end="00:39.873">ol</span><span begin="00:39.873" end="00:40.198">der,</span> <span begin="00:40.198" end="00:40.490">I'll</span> <span begin="00:40.490" end="00:40.781">be</span> <span begin="00:40.781" end="00:41.216">si</span><span begin="00:41.216" end="00:41.660">lent</span> <span begin="00:41.660" end="00:41.958">be</span><span begin="00:41.958" end="00:42.368">side</span> <span begin="00:42.368" end="00:43.114">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">年纪增大 在你身边 我逐渐变得沉默</span></p><p begin="00:43.784" end="00:45.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:43.784" end="00:43.941">I</span> <span begin="00:43.941" end="00:44.219">know</span> <span begin="00:44.219" end="00:44.710">words</span> <span begin="00:44.710" end="00:44.985">won't</span> <span begin="00:44.985" end="00:45.290">be</span> <span begin="00:45.290" end="00:45.423">e</span><span begin="00:45.423" end="00:45.952">nough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我深知 再多话语 也不足够</span></p><p begin="00:48.448" end="00:52.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:48.448" end="00:48.585">And</span> <span begin="00:48.585" end="00:48.695">they</span> <span begin="00:48.695" end="00:49.010">won't</span> <span begin="00:49.010" end="00:49.443">need</span> <span begin="00:49.443" end="00:49.730">to</span> <span begin="00:49.730" end="00:50.033">know</span> <span begin="00:50.033" end="00:50.363">the</span> <span begin="00:50.363" end="00:50.825">names</span> <span begin="00:50.825" end="00:51.270">or</span> <span begin="00:51.270" end="00:51.568">our</span> <span begin="00:51.568" end="00:52.009">fa</span><span begin="00:52.009" end="00:52.962">ces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们无需知道 我们的名字或模样</span></p><p begin="00:53.217" end="00:55.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:53.217" end="00:53.365">But</span> <span begin="00:53.365" end="00:53.520">they</span> <span begin="00:53.520" end="00:53.820">will</span> <span begin="00:53.820" end="00:54.277">car</span><span begin="00:54.277" end="00:54.452">ry</span> <span begin="00:54.452" end="00:54.867">on</span> <span begin="00:54.867" end="00:55.032">for</span> <span begin="00:55.032" end="00:55.835">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但他们也会一起 坚守下去</span></p><p begin="00:56.727" end="01:01.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:56.727" end="00:57.005">And</span> <span begin="00:57.005" end="00:57.299">it's</span> <span begin="00:57.299" end="00:57.588">a</span> <span begin="00:57.588" end="00:58.027">long</span> <span begin="00:58.027" end="00:58.477">way</span> <span begin="00:58.477" end="00:59.087">for</span><span begin="00:59.087" end="00:59.464">ward,</span> <span begin="00:59.742" end="00:59.964">so</span> <span begin="00:59.964" end="01:00.429">trust</span> <span begin="01:00.429" end="01:00.821">in</span> <span begin="01:00.821" end="01:01.476">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">纵使长路漫漫 希望你相信我</span></p><p begin="01:02.066" end="01:06.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:02.066" end="01:02.324">I'll</span> <span begin="01:02.324" end="01:02.844">give</span> <span begin="01:02.844" end="01:03.256">them</span> <span begin="01:03.256" end="01:03.876">shel</span><span begin="01:03.876" end="01:04.191">ter,</span> <span begin="01:04.191" end="01:04.469">like</span> <span begin="01:04.469" end="01:04.759">you've</span> <span begin="01:04.759" end="01:05.206">done</span> <span begin="01:05.206" end="01:05.629">for</span> <span begin="01:05.629" end="01:06.036">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我定尽力将他们庇护 正如你为我那样</span></p><p begin="01:06.294" end="01:12.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:06.294" end="01:06.586">And</span> <span begin="01:06.586" end="01:06.874">I</span> <span begin="01:06.874" end="01:07.391">know</span> <span begin="01:07.774" end="01:08.071">I'm</span> <span begin="01:08.071" end="01:08.989">not</span> <span begin="01:08.989" end="01:09.271">a</span><span begin="01:09.271" end="01:09.896">lone,</span> <span begin="01:10.176" end="01:10.476">you'll</span> <span begin="01:10.476" end="01:10.631">be</span> <span begin="01:10.631" end="01:11.059">wat</span><span begin="01:11.059" end="01:11.218">ching</span> <span begin="01:11.218" end="01:11.668">o</span><span begin="01:11.668" end="01:11.844">ver</span> <span begin="01:11.844" end="01:12.423">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我心知肚明 我并非一人 你总默默守护我们</span></p><p begin="01:12.586" end="01:14.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:12.586" end="01:12.894">Un</span><span begin="01:12.894" end="01:13.538">til</span> <span begin="01:13.784" end="01:14.243">you're</span> <span begin="01:14.243" end="01:14.969">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到你真正离去</span></p><p begin="02:22.178" end="02:25.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:22.178" end="02:22.483">I</span> <span begin="02:22.483" end="02:22.770">could</span> <span begin="02:22.770" end="02:23.095">ne</span><span begin="02:23.095" end="02:23.372">ver</span> <span begin="02:23.372" end="02:23.670">find</span> <span begin="02:23.670" end="02:23.965">the</span> <span begin="02:23.965" end="02:24.412">right</span> <span begin="02:24.412" end="02:24.840">way</span> <span begin="02:24.840" end="02:25.095">to</span> <span begin="02:25.095" end="02:25.585">tell</span> <span begin="02:25.585" end="02:25.987">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我找不到合理的方法告诉你</span></p><p begin="02:26.902" end="02:29.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="02:26.902" end="02:27.182">Have</span> <span begin="02:27.182" end="02:27.399">you</span> <span begin="02:27.399" end="02:27.849">no</span><span begin="02:27.849" end="02:28.064">ticed</span> <span begin="02:28.064" end="02:28.332">I've</span> <span begin="02:28.332" end="02:28.682">been</span> <span begin="02:28.682" end="02:29.189">gone?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:28.750" end="02:31.183"><span begin="02:28.750" end="02:29.028">(I</span> <span begin="02:29.028" end="02:29.228">won</span><span begin="02:29.228" end="02:29.368">der</span> <span begin="02:29.368" end="02:29.603">I</span> <span begin="02:29.603" end="02:29.810">won</span><span begin="02:29.810" end="02:29.963">der</span> <span begin="02:29.963" end="02:30.225">I</span> <span begin="02:30.225" end="02:30.421">won</span><span begin="02:30.421" end="02:30.565">der</span> <span begin="02:30.565" end="02:30.790">I</span> <span begin="02:30.790" end="02:31.005">won</span><span begin="02:31.005" end="02:31.183">der)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否察觉 我的身影已经遥远</spa